   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "Riding a motorcycle is more than just transportation—it’s a pursuit of freedom, an unfiltered connection to the road, the machine, and the passage of time itself. The Motoscaphe 120 is the first and only purpose-built tool watch for motorcyclists , designed with the same precision, durability, and mechanical integrity that define the finest riding machines. Inspired by the kinetic poetry of speed, the Motoscaphe 120 features a left-hand (destro) crown for unparalleled wrist comfort, a 12-hour bidirectional bezel for tracking time on long journeys, and a water resistance of 300 meters , ensuring resilience in all conditions. Whether worn on the open road or as an everyday companion, this watch is a tribute to the riders, explorers, and seekers of the horizon .",
